ured in October is appropriate by all economic measures, Simor said.\par \par \uc2 Nevertheless, "we can't spend the reserves without limits on defending the forint so their level won't fall below certain levels. We have to maintain a delicate balance (between \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves and the forint rate)," Simor said.\par \par \uc2 -By Edith Balazs and Margit Feher, Dow Jones Newswires; +361-267-0623; edith.balazs@dowjones.com\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 March 10, 2009 12:09 ET (16:09 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020090821e53a0myjb\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
