\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Hungary \highlight\uc2  forint weakens on Slovak  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  talk  \b0\par\par\uc2 545 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2007\par 10:15\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 BUDAPEST, March 20 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Hungary\b0 \highlight\uc2 's forint <EURHUF=D2> eased on Tuesday morning versus the euro taking a breather after a jump on Monday, triggered by the revaluation of Slovakia's crown and speculation about the future of the forint's band.  \par \par \uc2 Dealers said the forint eased on Tuesday on market talk that the Slovak \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to halt the crown's rise, which weakened the crown by about one percent.  \par \par \uc2 They said there were option deals with knock out levels at and also above the top of the forint's 30-percent trading band at 240.01 which may attract speculation to push the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  stronger, but at the moment interest was two-sided and the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  lacked the momentum to firm.  \par \par \uc2 At 0855 GMT the forint traded at 246.35 versus the euro, weaker from 245.50 on Monday and also down from opening levels at 245.95.  \par \par \uc2 Government bond yields were largely steady after a big fall on Monday.  \par \par \uc2 "I am not sure the spot has enough momentum to push to the end of the band and for speculators to attack the band," a dealer said.  \par \par \uc2 "But there are lots of option levels at 238 and 239 ... it is really up to London players whether they want to knock these out," he added.  \par \par \uc2 Another dealer said the next technical support level for the forint was at 241.  \par \par \uc2 Dealers also said they believed it was not in the interest of the government to let the forint appreciate further as a strong unit hurts exporters which is especially bad at a time when the economy is slowing anyway due to austerity measures.  \par \par \uc2 The revaluation of the central parity in the crown's band by 8.5 percent reignited speculation on Monday that Hungary could abandon its exchange rate band.  \par \par \uc2 The band can only be changed or abolished if both the bank and the government agree on it.  \par \par \uc2 "A more likely scenario in the short run is that the National Bank ends up accelerating its monetary easing, but here too the market may be in danger of expecting too much: the 9x12 FRA is now pricing in 100 bps of rate cuts this year," Citigroup said in a comment.  \par \par \uc2 "Much will depend on how clearly the government - which defines the exchange rate regime together with the NBH - communicates its intentions with respect to the \b \highlight22\uc2 fx intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band," he added.  \par \par \uc2 Hungarian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Andras Simor and Hungarian central bankers have either refused commenting on the forint band or said the issue was not on the agenda and the government has also said the issue was not on the agenda.  \par \par \uc2 The NBH's Monetary Council will hold its next rate-setting meeting and a news conference on March 26. ------------ MARKET SNAPSHOT AT 0855 GMT ------------ EUR/HUF <EURHUF=> eases to 246.35 from 245.50 USD/HUF <HUF=> eases to 185.60 from 184.45/70 3-yr 2009/F bond yield steady at 7.43/51 pct 5-yr 2012/B bond yield steady at 7.13/17 pct 10-yr 2017/B bond yield flat at 6.62/71 pct -----------------------------------------------------  \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-FORINT/BONDS|LANGEN|ABN|M|D|HX|RBN|RNP|DNP|PTD|PMF  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020070323e33k000nl\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
